    {
      "en": ": Greetings, Sir! To what or whom do I owe the pleasure?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ": 您好，先生！这份荣幸，我该记在什么事、还是什么人头上？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": To me. But you owe it in person and this phone call is me asking you to come do that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 记在我头上。不过你得亲自来还，这通电话就是来叫你过来还的。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": You want me to come do you?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ": 您是想让我过来跟您做？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or just come over. Whichever is easier.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 或者干脆过来就行。哪个方便选哪个。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's difficult to do anyone if you can not physically touch them, Sir. Technology has advanced quite a bit, but-",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ": 先生，如果不能实际接触到对方，要「做」是很难的。科技确实进步了不少，但——"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you coming or not?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 你到底来不来？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Aye aye! I'm on my way!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ": 遵命！我这就出发！"
    },
